WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
kikoeru ka kikoeru darou

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
<i>Can you hear it? I'm sure you can...</i>

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
harukana todoroki

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
<i>...that faraway roar!</i>

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
yami no naka kokoro yusaburu

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
<i>Your soul trembles in the darkness</i>

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
mezame hajimaru

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
<i>as it begins to awaken</i>

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
daichi wari sosoritatsu sugata

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
<i>A towering figure shatters the earth</i>

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
seigi no akashi ka

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
<i>Is it the symbol of justice?</i>

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
densetsu no kyojin no chikara

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
<i>The legendary giant's power</i>

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
ginga kirisaku

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
<i>will tear through the galaxy!</i>

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
otakebi ga denkou sekka no

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
<i>Our war cry will summon</i>

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
ichigeki wo yobu

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
<i>a flash of lightning!</i>

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
furueru na hitomi korase yo

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
<i>Have no fear, focus your eyes on...</i>

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
fukkatsu no toki

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
<i>the moment of resurrection!</i>

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
hito yo inochi yo hajimari wo miru

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
<i>Mankind and all life witness it begin</i>

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:03.160
<i>Space Runaway ldeon, Ideon</i>

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:10.170
<i>Space Runaway Ideon, Ideon</i>

00:01:32.840 --> 00:01:38.310
The strategy of Damido's Gil Bau squadron put the Ideon in a tight spot.

00:01:41.080 --> 00:01:46.790
However, Cosmo's wits and Gije's interference brought the battle to an end.

00:01:49.250 --> 00:01:55.210
<b>Escape Into Subspace</b>

00:02:12.980 --> 00:02:19.100
I want to form an attack squad consisting of the five top marksmen here.

00:02:19.100 --> 00:02:19.470
Yes sir!

00:02:19.470 --> 00:02:20.200
Please wait.

00:02:21.620 --> 00:02:25.440
Right now, Sir Gije is attempting to
 communicate with the Logo Dau aliens.

00:02:25.440 --> 00:02:27.680
Did he get permission from Sir Abadede?

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:28.640
Yes.

00:02:28.640 --> 00:02:31.910
Giving the enemy time to prepare is foolish!

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:39.020
I'll translate it.

00:02:39.670 --> 00:02:42.670
Three representatives from each side will meet up.

00:02:42.670 --> 00:02:45.010
The condition is to return Karala Ajiba.

00:02:46.140 --> 00:02:46.970
Karala?!

00:02:46.970 --> 00:02:48.110
Didn't I tell you?

00:02:48.110 --> 00:02:50.400
Their demands are totally one-sided.

00:02:50.720 --> 00:02:51.960
What are we going to do?

00:02:51.960 --> 00:02:54.480
We can't accept a demand like that!

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:58.190
Bes. You want to make use of our prisoners, don't you?

00:02:58.660 --> 00:02:59.730
Joliver!

00:02:59.730 --> 00:03:01.190
How's the DS drive?

00:03:01.190 --> 00:03:03.750
We can control the main engine, but...

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:08.830
The coordinates can't be set properly. In other words, we are unable to pick a destination.

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:12.580
Any place will do, as long as it's a planet we can live on.

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:15.870
If we fled to an Andromeda military advance base,

00:03:15.870 --> 00:03:17.330
We could defeat the Buff Clan...

00:03:17.330 --> 00:03:20.590
You want to let aliens know the whereabouts of other humans?

00:03:20.590 --> 00:03:22.320
We can't do that.

00:03:22.320 --> 00:03:23.820
They're fellow humans.

00:03:23.820 --> 00:03:26.070
We have a responsibility to help each other.

00:03:26.520 --> 00:03:29.700
The human race isn't that altruistic.

00:03:30.120 --> 00:03:32.170
In any case, we're escaping from planet Solo.

00:03:32.170 --> 00:03:34.350
Cut off contact with the Buff Clan!

00:03:34.350 --> 00:03:35.910
I'll be on standby in the Ideon.

00:03:40.330 --> 00:03:45.170
Andromeda 6th division, Braziller. Andromeda 6th division, Braziller.

00:03:45.170 --> 00:03:47.620
This is Planet Solo. Please respond.

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:48.690
Stop it, Sheryl!

00:03:48.690 --> 00:03:49.540
Why?!

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:53.580
An amateur can't find the correct target using the Black Hole Galaxy Transmitter.

00:03:53.580 --> 00:03:55.100
Sir Abadede!

00:03:55.610 --> 00:03:59.310
Trying to communicate with the aliens is futile.

00:03:59.310 --> 00:04:00.770
Please give the order to attack!

00:04:00.770 --> 00:04:01.590
No.

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:05.180
If they agree to our conditions, we can talk and convince them to surrender.

00:04:05.790 --> 00:04:10.640
There hasn't been an answer from the Logo Dau aliens yet, Damido.

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:12.550
Sir Abadede!

00:04:12.550 --> 00:04:15.120
They're refusing to contact us!

00:04:15.120 --> 00:04:15.920
But...

00:04:15.920 --> 00:04:18.060
Sir Abadede, give me the order to attack!

00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:21.870
Show me some results this time!

00:04:21.870 --> 00:04:25.560
Roger! I shall wipe them out without fail!

00:04:39.420 --> 00:04:41.110
Sir Abadede... Why?!

00:04:41.110 --> 00:04:43.880
Gije, forget about Lady Karala.

00:04:46.030 --> 00:04:48.600
You've been too fixated on trying to rescue her,

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:51.240
And now you're lagging far behind Damido.

00:04:51.240 --> 00:04:55.080
Would Supreme Commander Doba be
pleased with what's become of you?

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:58.460
Besides, Lady Karala doesn't suit you...

00:04:59.310 --> 00:05:00.770
Sir Abadede...

00:05:01.210 --> 00:05:05.400
If you could find the Ide, you'd be promoted to the rank of Hang.

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:07.700
So focus your efforts on the search for Ide.

00:05:09.520 --> 00:05:11.610
I value your ability.

00:05:12.090 --> 00:05:14.270
But if you lived together with Karala,

00:05:14.270 --> 00:05:16.640
You'd be under her thumb for all your life.

00:05:17.130 --> 00:05:17.670
Yes sir...

00:05:18.530 --> 00:05:21.630
Enemy closing in on combat line 3!

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:25.390
Stop repairing the Ideon machines and put them on launch standby!

00:05:29.670 --> 00:05:30.960
No reaction from the enemy.

00:05:30.960 --> 00:05:34.150
Alright. Let's surround the spaceship and attack.

00:05:34.150 --> 00:05:35.460
What about Lady Karala?

00:05:35.880 --> 00:05:39.100
Sir Abadede said nothing about her. Don't concern yourself.

00:05:39.650 --> 00:05:43.350
They've circled to our left! Raise all anti-air guns to the deck!

00:05:43.350 --> 00:05:44.490
It is fixed?

00:05:44.490 --> 00:05:48.760
It's 80 percent finished. We can still fight,
just don't go overboard.

00:05:48.760 --> 00:05:49.310
Roger!

00:05:49.310 --> 00:05:50.030
They're here!

00:05:55.530 --> 00:05:56.830
Commence attack!

00:06:11.320 --> 00:06:13.470
Damn the Buff Clan! Bes, lets go!

00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:14.340
Roger!

00:06:15.990 --> 00:06:17.460
Joliver, cover me.

00:06:17.460 --> 00:06:19.020
Don't let the enemy get close to us.

00:06:24.330 --> 00:06:27.070
They've never attacked this aggressively before!

00:06:34.640 --> 00:06:37.290
Damn Buff Clan, they're so fast! Why is that?!

00:06:41.480 --> 00:06:43.210
Back portion, are you shooting?

00:06:43.460 --> 00:06:46.130
They're acting different than usual! Get further away!

00:06:46.130 --> 00:06:47.130
Understood!

00:06:51.290 --> 00:06:52.910
Ah, Techno! In front!

00:06:55.310 --> 00:06:57.850
Kasha! Watch your back!

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:05.690
They're trying to separate us from the Solo Ship!

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:10.240
I understand why they're attacking so aggressively!

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:12.160
They've decided to abandon Karala!

00:07:19.120 --> 00:07:21.900
Third block, get more people and fight back!

00:07:21.900 --> 00:07:24.340
There's only two enemy units!

00:07:24.340 --> 00:07:26.070
Hey, give me a damage report!

00:07:34.830 --> 00:07:37.330
Don't run away! Hey!

00:07:37.330 --> 00:07:39.050
Not at a time like this!

00:07:44.580 --> 00:07:48.260
My lady, have they abandoned us?

00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:52.450
If Gije has contacted father or my sister Harulu...

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:54.050
Then we've been abandoned.

00:07:54.050 --> 00:07:55.190
No!

00:07:55.190 --> 00:07:57.540
About the Ide... and the aliens...

00:07:58.520 --> 00:08:00.950
My father won't accept defeat.

00:08:00.950 --> 00:08:03.210
Losing one life probably means nothing to him.

00:08:03.210 --> 00:08:04.800
Please stop!

00:08:04.800 --> 00:08:07.790
I'm more afraid of my own relatives than the aliens.

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:09.880
N... No...

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:13.690
Emergency! It's an emergency!

00:08:13.690 --> 00:08:17.590
Someone please come here! It's an emergency! Is someone there?

00:08:17.590 --> 00:08:18.240
What is it?

00:08:18.240 --> 00:08:19.290
Mayaya...

00:08:19.290 --> 00:08:20.490
Over there...

00:08:20.980 --> 00:08:22.000
There's smoke...

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:23.600
Wait... Wait there a second!

00:08:25.720 --> 00:08:27.490
It's over there. Over there.

00:08:27.490 --> 00:08:28.570
Where?

00:08:31.060 --> 00:08:32.040
Damn you!

00:08:36.760 --> 00:08:39.130
My lady, please escape quickly!

00:08:39.130 --> 00:08:40.370
Mayaya...

00:08:40.370 --> 00:08:42.270
Y-You...

00:08:42.270 --> 00:08:44.540
I beg you, Lady Karala. Hurry...

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:45.850
Hey, what's wrong?

00:08:48.070 --> 00:08:50.640
My lady, please escape quickly!

00:08:50.640 --> 00:08:52.030
My lady, hurry!

00:08:52.610 --> 00:08:54.020
That woman!

00:08:54.020 --> 00:08:54.970
Hurry!

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:56.110
Please escape!

00:08:56.110 --> 00:08:58.280
Mayaya... Stop! Stop it!

00:08:58.280 --> 00:08:59.800
I'm staying here!

00:09:06.660 --> 00:09:08.210
Mayaya! Mayaya!

00:09:13.660 --> 00:09:15.020
My lady...

00:09:15.490 --> 00:09:20.270
I... I went too far, didn't I?

00:09:20.270 --> 00:09:21.090
Mayaya...

00:09:21.090 --> 00:09:22.390
Lady Karala...

00:09:23.210 --> 00:09:24.290
Mayaya...

00:09:25.440 --> 00:09:26.790
Mayaya!

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:34.840
I always wanted you to be by my side...

00:09:47.930 --> 00:09:50.320
Why can't we hit them? Aim carefully!

00:09:52.170 --> 00:09:54.610
Why aren't they falling? Why aren't they falling?!

00:09:57.610 --> 00:09:59.280
Kasha, don't chase them too far!

00:09:59.280 --> 00:10:00.340
It's alright!

00:10:00.340 --> 00:10:02.850
I'll take them down easily!

00:10:02.850 --> 00:10:04.270
Listen to what I say!

00:10:04.270 --> 00:10:05.130
They're coming!

00:10:06.850 --> 00:10:08.770
The enemies are combat experts!

00:10:08.770 --> 00:10:10.370
You're going to get killed if you dawdle around!

00:10:10.370 --> 00:10:11.400
Bes, do you hear me?

00:10:12.620 --> 00:10:14.330
The DS Drive is fully prepared.

00:10:14.330 --> 00:10:15.980
Return at once.

00:10:15.980 --> 00:10:19.010
Okay, I got it. Kasha, Cosmo, did you hear that?

00:10:19.010 --> 00:10:21.570
Yeah, I heard you.

00:10:21.570 --> 00:10:24.140
You'd better make sure Kasha got it too.

00:10:24.140 --> 00:10:24.990
What?

00:10:29.540 --> 00:10:32.330
Kasha! I'll cover you, return to the Solo Ship!

00:10:32.330 --> 00:10:34.630
I can handle this, there's only two or three of them!

00:10:34.630 --> 00:10:38.360
You should be glad you haven't been hit for once!

00:10:43.720 --> 00:10:44.580
I can't shake them off!

00:10:44.760 --> 00:10:48.740
That enemy unit is as good as dead! Concentrate your fire on it!

00:11:13.020 --> 00:11:14.340
We're being pulled in?

00:11:14.950 --> 00:11:17.190
Something strange is going on!

00:11:25.000 --> 00:11:27.050
Th... they...

00:11:39.610 --> 00:11:43.730
They activated their Subspace Drive?

00:11:49.970 --> 00:11:52.410
Those crazy aliens!

00:11:52.410 --> 00:11:55.680
The Subspace Drive should be used for outer space voyages!

00:11:56.090 --> 00:11:59.980
They're a violent breed.
 Tell Sir Abadede to pursue them!

00:11:59.980 --> 00:12:00.650
Roger!

00:12:13.440 --> 00:12:16.050
Subspace sensor, track them immediately!

00:12:16.050 --> 00:12:17.720
Prepare the Subspace Drive!

00:12:17.720 --> 00:12:21.120
Tell Damido to return to the Gram Zan and follow us.

00:12:21.120 --> 00:12:22.090
Roger!

00:12:22.090 --> 00:12:24.300
Gije, do you understand?

00:12:24.590 --> 00:12:27.130
I've been waiting for this chance.

00:12:27.130 --> 00:12:29.730
I'll let you have the Heavy Mobile Mecha Giran Dou.

00:12:29.730 --> 00:12:32.050
Attack that giant in subspace!

00:12:32.430 --> 00:12:33.730
Sir Abadede!

00:12:33.730 --> 00:12:38.890
Meanwhile, I'll approach their spaceship with the Gataman Zan and rescue Lady Karala.

00:12:39.940 --> 00:12:45.490
You aren't the only person recognized by Supreme Commander Doba.

00:12:45.490 --> 00:12:48.410
Lady Karala is a completely different matter, though.

00:12:49.180 --> 00:12:50.360
Well...

00:13:22.450 --> 00:13:25.130
Just set our alignment to standard!

00:13:25.130 --> 00:13:27.070
Check all the coordinates, fast!

00:13:27.290 --> 00:13:30.370
I'm working on it, but I have no idea where we're heading!

00:13:30.370 --> 00:13:33.590
It'd be good if we could aim for M-84, but...

00:13:33.590 --> 00:13:36.340
Joliver! Where's Sheryl?

00:13:36.340 --> 00:13:37.330
How would I know?

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:39.450
We need her to analyze the enemy's language!

00:13:39.450 --> 00:13:41.950
Wasn't she going to do something with Karala?

00:13:43.130 --> 00:13:46.810
The Buff's Earth is next to the Gido Nebula...

00:13:46.810 --> 00:13:51.470
The Gido Nebula has 2 halves, the Zenji
Nebula and the Gundam Nebula...

00:13:52.240 --> 00:13:54.380
I'm going to show you a map of the known universe.

00:13:54.380 --> 00:13:56.700
Please locate the nebulae you spoke of.

00:13:56.700 --> 00:13:57.430
Sheryl!

00:13:58.050 --> 00:14:00.990
Who gave you permission to examine Karala?

00:14:00.990 --> 00:14:04.610
Wasn't it you who wanted to learn more about the enemy?

00:14:04.610 --> 00:14:06.070
What kind of machine is this?

00:14:06.320 --> 00:14:09.810
It's a Confessograph, which makes people to say their thoughts aloud.

00:14:09.810 --> 00:14:13.380
Karala is willing to cooperate. You didn't have to use this!

00:14:13.380 --> 00:14:15.530
How would you know her true intentions?

00:14:15.530 --> 00:14:20.560
Yeah, Sheryl, but does a machine made for humans work on the Buff Clan?

00:14:20.560 --> 00:14:23.460
Karala is identical to us.

00:14:23.460 --> 00:14:25.330
But what if they were a hostile race?

00:14:25.640 --> 00:14:31.800
We can't say anything for certain right now.
 Anyway, we might learn more about the Ide.

00:14:32.880 --> 00:14:38.310
If we could obtain the infinite energy, how do we use it?

00:14:38.820 --> 00:14:41.440
That's what we need to hear from Karala.

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:55.820
The Ide is the origin of an infinite energy...

00:14:55.820 --> 00:14:58.720
I don't know about the finer details.

00:14:58.720 --> 00:15:03.420
But there is scientific evidence that proves it exists.

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:06.840
Is this energy stronger than anti-matter energy?

00:15:07.290 --> 00:15:08.970
It's far greater.

00:15:09.350 --> 00:15:11.060
It is love.

00:15:11.060 --> 00:15:15.850
It is something like the love that gives
people hope, courage, and enthusiasm.

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:17.600
What the?!

00:15:17.850 --> 00:15:19.730
What is she talking about?

00:15:19.730 --> 00:15:22.160
We asked about the Ide energy!

00:15:22.160 --> 00:15:25.450
I believe that's what the Ide energy is.

00:15:26.200 --> 00:15:31.360
Does something as convenient as infinite energy really exist in this universe?

00:15:32.180 --> 00:15:34.530
Th, this woman Karala...

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:37.600
She doesn't have any scientific knowledge.

00:15:37.600 --> 00:15:39.750
She's a complete idealist!

00:15:40.390 --> 00:15:42.770
Then this was all for nothing!

00:15:42.770 --> 00:15:45.500
Yeah! What a waste of time!

00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:46.460
True!

00:15:47.060 --> 00:15:48.850
I wouldn't say that.

00:15:48.850 --> 00:15:51.710
Should I have her show us the Buff Clan's planet?

00:15:51.710 --> 00:15:55.370
If we showed her a map of the entire
universe, Karala wouldn't understand it.

00:15:55.370 --> 00:15:56.430
Yes.

00:15:56.700 --> 00:15:59.650
She would understand a Buff Clan map though...

00:16:01.570 --> 00:16:03.890
Anyway, this person is totally harmless.

00:16:03.890 --> 00:16:07.730
I feel envious. Looking at her... she's a pretty woman.

00:16:17.120 --> 00:16:19.290
Don't let anyone else approach her!

00:16:19.290 --> 00:16:20.780
We'll investigate more later!

00:16:21.430 --> 00:16:23.660
What should we investigate?

00:16:23.660 --> 00:16:26.950
Joliver! Hatari! Get Cosmo and Kasha to the Ideon!

00:16:26.950 --> 00:16:28.930
Can we use the Ideon in DS drive?

00:16:28.930 --> 00:16:31.170
Well, is the Ideon Gauge on?

00:16:31.170 --> 00:16:31.920
It is.

00:16:31.920 --> 00:16:33.950
Then it's possible. Let's go!

00:16:40.280 --> 00:16:41.360
Go ahead!

00:16:41.810 --> 00:16:43.440
Cosmo, Kasha!

00:16:43.440 --> 00:16:46.820
If the monitor turns red, that's a sign
that the DS Drive is weakening!

00:16:46.820 --> 00:16:48.840
Don't let it turn red, no matter what.

00:16:49.220 --> 00:16:52.570
And don't stray outside the lines on left and right. You'll get thrown off course.

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:55.080
Roger! But what do you mean by weakening?

00:16:55.080 --> 00:16:59.300
If you divert from the course,
you could get pulled inside the subspace.

00:16:59.300 --> 00:17:01.540
You'll end up in some unexpected location!

00:17:07.210 --> 00:17:10.890
They're using a barrier in subspace? What incredible power!

00:17:10.890 --> 00:17:12.430
Turn us 180 degrees!

00:17:12.430 --> 00:17:12.880
Yes sir!

00:17:20.520 --> 00:17:22.670
The gauge is on, let's launch!

00:17:22.670 --> 00:17:23.560
Roger!

00:17:38.900 --> 00:17:40.960
It seems the Giant has stood up!

00:17:40.960 --> 00:17:43.540
Will we fight them in subspace?

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:46.890
Only hit and run tactics work inside the subspace.

00:17:47.280 --> 00:17:49.080
The Giant isn't capable of that.

00:17:57.990 --> 00:17:58.910
They're fast!

00:18:10.900 --> 00:18:13.690
Our position! I can't see the Solo Ship!

00:18:15.840 --> 00:18:17.230
How's the main engine?

00:18:17.230 --> 00:18:18.810
It's at maximum power!

00:18:18.810 --> 00:18:19.930
Damn!

00:18:24.720 --> 00:18:25.640
I understand!

00:18:25.640 --> 00:18:28.870
If we navigate outside of here, we could end up in another universe!

00:18:28.870 --> 00:18:29.460
That's right!

00:18:33.660 --> 00:18:36.070
Even the particle launcher isn't enough...

00:18:36.070 --> 00:18:39.650
Concentrate our attack on a single spot! It has to go down!

00:18:44.770 --> 00:18:46.020
Those freaks!

00:18:51.340 --> 00:18:53.230
Pull back! Pull back!

00:18:55.110 --> 00:18:58.690
The Giant has that kind of power inside the subspace too?

00:19:00.820 --> 00:19:02.310
Bes, return!

00:19:02.310 --> 00:19:04.460
The enemy's warship is attacking us!

00:19:04.460 --> 00:19:06.310
What? The enemy's ship?

00:19:06.310 --> 00:19:07.730
They really are pros!

00:19:07.730 --> 00:19:09.510
Kasha! Fire a barrage!

00:19:09.510 --> 00:19:11.830
I'm doing that! We need to get back to the Solo Ship!

00:19:19.300 --> 00:19:21.820
The Giant is turning back!

00:19:21.820 --> 00:19:24.720
It must be going back to protect their spaceship!

00:19:37.120 --> 00:19:38.740
They're different from before!

00:19:39.320 --> 00:19:40.680
We'll be alright.

00:19:40.680 --> 00:19:42.540
Cosmo will chase them away!

00:19:45.200 --> 00:19:47.050
So that's the enemy ship?

00:19:50.870 --> 00:19:53.610
The Giant is closing in from the rear! Barrage them!

00:19:53.610 --> 00:19:54.540
Don't panic!

00:19:54.540 --> 00:19:57.430
The enemy has just one unit. Aim well and we'll hit it!

00:20:01.080 --> 00:20:03.400
How can they attack with such force?!

00:20:06.120 --> 00:20:07.900
Damn Giant! Fall down!

00:20:21.930 --> 00:20:23.320
Cosmo, get away from it!

00:20:23.320 --> 00:20:24.490
The enemies are professionals!

00:20:24.490 --> 00:20:25.320
R, roger!

00:20:25.320 --> 00:20:27.090
Firing all missiles on front!

00:20:35.510 --> 00:20:36.760
Trying to escape?!

00:20:38.850 --> 00:20:40.540
The enemy's overwhelming us!

00:20:40.540 --> 00:20:42.790
Cosmo, get in front of the Solo Ship!

00:20:42.790 --> 00:20:43.760
What are we going to do?

00:20:43.760 --> 00:20:44.640
We need to escape!

00:20:44.640 --> 00:20:45.590
How?

00:20:45.590 --> 00:20:48.640
It's too difficult to get away, let's fight them!

00:20:48.640 --> 00:20:52.140
Consider what kind of enemy we're facing if we survive!

00:20:56.930 --> 00:20:58.990
Don't let it escape! Chase it! Chase it!

00:21:01.470 --> 00:21:03.560
The enemy thinks they've escaped.

00:21:03.560 --> 00:21:05.990
Those aliens are taking us too lightly!

00:21:10.280 --> 00:21:13.520
Okay, dock with the ship and stop the DS Drive!

00:21:13.520 --> 00:21:15.540
What'd you say? The DS Drive...

00:21:15.540 --> 00:21:16.790
No!

00:21:16.790 --> 00:21:21.240
That's absurd! We don't know about our current position at all!

00:21:21.240 --> 00:21:23.740
I don't care! Do you want to get killed?

00:21:24.960 --> 00:21:28.450
Okay, Cosmo, Kasha, prepare to dock!

00:21:44.380 --> 00:21:45.670
Docking completed!

00:21:45.670 --> 00:21:49.740
DS Drive Brake!

00:22:00.630 --> 00:22:02.130
Damn it!

00:22:02.130 --> 00:22:05.490
Did the aliens stop their Subspace Drive?

00:22:07.000 --> 00:22:11.010
Who knew they'd do something like that!

00:22:11.410 --> 00:22:15.300
The DS Drive is stopping! Find out where we are!

00:22:36.900 --> 00:22:38.220
It's a planet!

00:22:51.050 --> 00:22:57.970
<i>Escaping from the exhausted Solo Ship, Deck and Ashura go explore a planet of dinosaurs.</i>

00:22:58.390 --> 00:23:04.440
<i>Cosmo and the others are chased by a
Heavy Mobile Mecha piloted by Gije.</i>

00:23:04.440 --> 00:23:09.900
<i>Challenged to a duel,  Cosmo pulls out his knife for the sake of the children!</i>

00:23:09.900 --> 00:23:14.920
